ADDITIONAL NOTICE — GOVERNMENT PROCUREMENT CONTEXT:

This software is designed for demonstration and educational purposes as part of
the Smart India Hackathon 2026 (SIH 2026). It simulates compliance verification
workflows for Government e-Marketplace (GeM) procurement.

The following are simulated/mock in this release and must NOT be used for actual
government procurement decisions without proper authorization:

1. Mock Government API integrations (GSTN, ITD, MSME Udyam Portal, NIC)
2. Demo bidder data and pre-seeded accounts
3. Simulated document verification results

The "AI NEVER automatically approves or rejects a bidder" principle is
hardcoded into the system architecture. Final procurement decisions are legally
reserved for the authorized Procurement Officer.

For production deployment in actual GeM procurement workflows, proper
authorization, auditing, and integration with live government APIs via
API Setu / NIC is required.
